/*
//SPELL SHIELD//
COPY "weidu_external/rick_bigg_mod/workspace/spell/SPWI519.spl" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Spell Shield"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC 
"Spell Shield
Level: 5
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast the wizard is protected from the next magical attack against him. If one of those spells is cast at the wizard this spell activates and absorbs the attack. However, this only works once as this spell is consumed in the process.

The spells that Spell Shield protects the wizard from are: Spell Thrust, Abjure Defense, Pierce Magic, Unraveling Gaze, Khelben's Warding Whip, Pierce Shield, and Spellstrike.
"
*/

//CONJURE LESSER ELEMENTAL//
COPY "weidu_external/rick_bigg_mod/workspace/spell/SPWI599.spl" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Conjure Lesser Elemental"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC 
"Conjure Lesser Elemental
Level: 5
School: Conjuration
Range: Medium
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting Conjure Lesser Elemental, the caster chooses an element and opens a special gate to the relative Plane, and an elemental is summoned to the vicinity of the spellcaster. The elemental serves the caster's every whim until banished back to its home plane, the spell duration expires, or upon the elemental's death.

Lesser Air Elemental (8 Hit Dice):
STR 14, DEX 17, CON 16, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 80, AC 0, THAC0 8, Saving Throws 10/12/11/11/13
3 Attacks Per Round, 1d6+2 Piercing Damage (Fist +2)
Special Qualities:
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, sleep, & stun effects
Slashing, Crushing, & Piercing Resistance 20%; Missile Resistance 60%


Lesser Earth Elemental (8 Hit Dice):
STR 19, DEX 8, CON 18, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 96, AC 4, THAC0 8, Saving Throws 10/12/11/11/13
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d6+9 Crushing Damage (Fist +2)
Special Qualities:
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Slashing, Piercing, & Missile Resistance 40%


Lesser Fire Elemental (8 Hit Dice):
STR 14, DEX 16, CON 16, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 80, AC 2, THAC0 10, Saving Throws 10/12/11/11/13
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d4+2 Slashing +2d4 Fire Damage (Fist +2)
Special Qualities:
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Fire Resistance 100%
Slashing, Crushing, Piercing, & Missile Resistance 20%


Lesser Water Elemental (8 Hit Dice):
STR 10, DEX 17, CON 16, INT 6, WIS 11, CHA 11;  AL Neutral
HP 64, AC 2, THAC0 10, Saving Throws 10/12/11/11/13
2 Attacks Per Round, 2d4+2 Missile +1d6 Magic Damage (Wave +2)
Special Qualities:
Immune to normal weapons
Immune to hold, poison, polymorph, sleep, & stun effects
Magic Damage Resistance 100%
Slashing, Crushing, & Piercing Resistance 20%; Missile Resistance 60%
"


